DESCRIPTION:1.9 mi warm-up\; 2 x (3.0 mi at 7:22 to 7:31/mi\, HR cap 164\
 , 3:00 min jog)\; 1.2 mi cool-down.\nGo/no-go: under 12h of recovery tim
 e left\, go. 12 to 24h\, the heart-rate cap is absolute. Over 24h\, move
  it a day.\nDecides the race goal. Run it rested\, in race shoes\, by ef
 fort inside the band\; the heart-rate cap matters more than the fast end
  of the band.\nStrength: Strength\, 10 minutes after the run: calf raise
 s\, side planks\, single-leg balance. Low soreness only\; heavy lifting 
 waits for the next block.\nShoes: Run the decision session in the shoes 
 you intend to race in. Decide today\, not race week.\nCaffeine: If you w
 ill use caffeine on race day\, take the same dose at the same lead time 
 before this session.
END:VEVENT
